      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 692.32,
        "r": 503.5500000000002,
        "b": 684.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0788",
      "reading_order": 882,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 679.32,
        "r": 557.4100000000001,
        "b": 661.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove access panel. Remove control board cover to access control board.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0789",
      "reading_order": 883,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 656.32,
        "r": 573.3900000000001,
        "b": 628.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Lay the dishwasher on its back. Use a small flat-blade screwdriver to unclip snaps around the drip-pan. Remove drip-pan/float switch to access under tub components.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0790",
      "reading_order": 884,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 623.32,
        "r": 575.6400000000001,
        "b": 595.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Check hose connections between the pressure switch and sump. Ensure hose is routed correctly and not pinched or crimped.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0791",
      "reading_order": 885,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 590.32,
        "r": 574.87,
        "b": 572.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Verify there is no debris in the hose. Check hose for leaks. Repair or replace as needed.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0792",
      "reading_order": 886,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 567.32,
        "r": 569.7492000000001,
        "b": 549.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Check the following harnesses for continuity (refer to the following chart).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_880",
          "title": "Test Procedure"
        }
      ],
      "page": 41,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0793",
      "reading_order": 887,
      "section": "Test Procedure",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 335.0,
        "t": 482.54,
        "r": 557.5200000000001,
        "b": 453.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "¾ ¾ If an open circuit is detected, check connections between control board, pressure switch, and drain pump. Repair or replace as necessary.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
          "title": "24' Product and Cabinet Opening Dimensions PRODUCT AND CABINET OPENING DIMENSIONS:"
