        "l": 327.0,
        "t": 435.32,
        "r": 572.2800000000002,
        "b": 407.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Check the pressure switch. Using an ohmmeter, measure the resistance across the pressure switch terminals (refer to the following chart).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
