        "r": 565.9900000000004,
        "b": 287.7303225806452
      },
      "content": "¾ ¾ If all pressure switch checks pass, continue to step 8.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_880",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
